stash] Logstash Overview - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/logstash-79270240-48ee-11ee-8cb5-99927777c522\n[Elastic Agent] Overview - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/elastic_agent-a148dc70-6b3c-11ed-98de-67bdecd21824\nRunbook :\nRunbook scénario - https://github.com/France-Travail/pass-emploi-tools/blob/master/docs/observabilite/runbooks/runbook-logstash.md#scénario-4--crash-du-conteneur-logstash{% if foreach.item.labels %}{% if foreach.item.labels.dependabot_url %}{% assign pages = foreach.item.labels.dependabot_url | split: '@@' %}{% else %}{% assign pages = foreach.item.labels | map: 'dependabot_url' | compact | uniq %}{% endif %}{% if pages.size > 0 %}\nAlertes Dependabot :{% for u in pages %}{% assign morceaux = u | split: '/' %}\n{{ morceaux[4] }} - {{ u }}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endif %}\nRègle :\n{{ event.rule.name | replace: '=', '＝' }} - {{ event.ruleUrl }}{% when 'da91356c-39dc-4033-bc47-83421974a049' %}{% assign t0 = foreach.item.kibana.alert.start | date: '%s' | minus: 3600 | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}{% assign t1 = foreach.item.kibana.alert.start | date: '%s' | plus: 900 | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}⚠️ Backpressure Logstash staging/perf — le pipeline ingest a au moins un thread HTTP bloqué en continu depuis 15 min (queue_backpressure ≥ 1).\nDéclenchée à : {{ foreach.item.kibana.alert.start }}{% if event.rule.tags contains 'tchap-lignes' and foreach.item.message %}{% for ligne in foreach.item.message %}\n• {{ ligne | replace: '=', '＝' }}{% endfor %}{% elsif event.rule.tags contains 'jobs' and foreach.item.labels %}{% if foreach.item.labels.job_type %}{% assign jobs = foreach.item.labels.job_type | split: '@@' %}{% assign un = true %}{% else %}{% assign jobs = foreach.item.labels | map: 'job_type' | uniq %}{% assign un = false %}{% endif %}{% for job in jobs %}{% if un %}{% assign nb = 1 %}{% else %}{% assign nb = foreach.item.labels | where: 'job_type', job | size %}{% endif %}\n❌ {{ job | replace: '=', '＝' }} : {{ nb }} échec(s){% endfor %}{% if foreach.item.error.message %}\nErreurs :{% for m in foreach.item.error.message %}\n{{ m | replace: '=', '＝' }}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endif %}\nNœud :\n{{ foreach.item.kibana.alert.instance.id | replace: '=', '＝' }}\nDashboards :\n[Pass Emploi] Supervision Stack d'Observabilité - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/fd40a516-c323-4e5e-91e5-1328b8b1a78d\n[Metrics Logstash] Logstash Single Pipeline View - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/logstash-bc1a8050-5ee1-11ee-8e78-bf6865bc3ffc\n[Metrics Logstash] Input plugin Info - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/logstash-8f8c78a0-6e9e-11ee-86f6-d7074508d975\n[Metrics Logstash] Output plugin info - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/dashboards#/view/logstash-fe17b800-6eb4-11ee-86f6-d7074508d975\nRunbook :\nRunbook scénario - https://github.com/France-Travail/pass-emploi-tools/blob/master/docs/observabilite/runbooks/runbook-logstash.md#scénario-1--backpressure-elasticsearch{% if foreach.item.labels %}{% if foreach.item.labels.dependabot_url %}{% assign pages = foreach.item.labels.dependabot_url | split: '@@' %}{% else %}{% assign pages = foreach.item.labels | map: 'dependabot_url' | compact | uniq %}{% endif %}{% if pages.size > 0 %}\nAlertes Dependabot :{% for u in pages %}{% assign morceaux = u | split: '/' %}\n{{ morceaux[4] }} - {{ u }}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endif %}\nRègle :\n{{ event.rule.name | replace: '=', '＝' }} - {{ event.ruleUrl }}{% when '9f9c07f9-07a9-40a3-a882-4a701e81b83c' %}{% assign t0 = foreach.item.kibana.alert.start | date: '%s' | minus: 3600 | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}{% assign t1 = foreach.item.kibana.alert.start | date: '%s' | plus: 900 | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}⚠️ Heap JVM Logstash staging/perf — le heap reste au-dessus de 90 % depuis 15 min : le GC ne libè