ver sessions :\n[Pass Emploi] Alertes externes Hors-Prod - Événements Scalingo - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/discover#/view/33bed466-9d68-4789-a723-aeea34e6cd93?_g=%28time%3A%28from%3A%27{{ t0 }}%27%2Cto%3A%27{{ t1 }}%27%29%29\n[Pass Emploi] Logs Hors-Prod - DLQ Logstash Process - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/discover#/view/e5bec6b4-0ae3-47b1-8bb5-2e9bf77493a4?_g=%28time%3A%28from%3A%27{{ t0 }}%27%2Cto%3A%27{{ t1 }}%27%29%29\n[Pass Emploi] Logs Hors-Prod - Erreurs de traitement Logstash Process - https://pass-emploi.kb.eu-west-3.aws.elastic-cloud.com/app/discover#/view/716175ed-b2a0-4fe1-8f9d-1892d04dbe92?_g=%28time%3A%28from%3A%27{{ t0 }}%27%2Cto%3A%27{{ t1 }}%27%29%29{% if foreach.item.labels %}{% if foreach.item.labels.dependabot_url %}{% assign pages = foreach.item.labels.dependabot_url | split: '@@' %}{% else %}{% assign pages = foreach.item.labels | map: 'dependabot_url' | compact | uniq %}{% endif %}{% if pages.size > 0 %}\nAlertes Dependabot :{% for u in pages %}{% assign morceaux = u | split: '/' %}\n{{ morceaux[4] }} - {{ u }}{% endfor %}{% endif %}{% endif %}\nRègle :\n{{ event.rule.name | replace: '=', '＝' }} - {{ event.ruleUrl }}{% when '720d949a-f73f-43e5-bc46-ff22c7b96cfb' %}{% assign t0 = foreach.item.kibana.alert.start | date: '%s' | minus: 3600 | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}{% assign t1 = foreach.item.kibana.alert.start | date: '%s' | plus: 900 | date: '%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ' %}⚠️ Backlog Redis staging/perf — la liste logstash:ingest reste au-dessus de 1 000 événements depuis 15 min. Le pipeline process ne consomme plus Redis.\nDéclenchée à : {{ foreach.item.kibana.alert.start }}{% if event.rule.tags contains 'tchap-lignes' and foreach.item.message %}{% for ligne in foreach.item.message %}\n• {{ ligne | replace: '=', '＝' }}{% endfor %}{% elsif event.rule.tags contains 'jobs' and foreach.item.labels %}{% if foreach.item.labels.job_type %}{% assign jobs = foreach.item.labels.job_type | split: